The Petitioner seeks clarification that this unit description includes all student employees in this unit, regardless of:
1.	The source of the funding from which the Employer provides compensation to them;
2.	The form of the compensation that they receive;
3.	The payment system through which they receive compensation;
4.	Their appointment status;
5.	Their job or position title;
6.	The number of hours they work;
7.	The duration of their employment;
8.	Their teaching or research rotation status;
9.	The term during which they work;
10.	The degree program in which they are enrolled;
11.	Their year enrolled in the degree program; or
12.	The institution at which they are enrolled, provided it is affiliated with the Employer.

